      {"name":"NE555_D","lib_name":"Timer"},{"name":"V","lib_name":"Device"},{"name":"GND","lib_name":"Device"}
      ,{"name":"R","lib_Name":"Device"},{"name":"C","lib_Name":"Device"}
      , {"name":"LED","lib_name":"Device"} ,{"name":"SW_PUSH","lib_name":"Device"},{ "name":"Battery","lib_name":"Device"
      }
  ]
}
```

(Note: The symbol name for the NE555 in the Timer library is “NE555_D”. Adjust the exact name if your library uses a slightly different spelling such as “NE555D”.)<|return|>
